@api = https://localhost:7201

### Create a tenant
POST {{api}}/api/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "contoso",
  "name": "Contoso",
  "contactEmail": "it@contoso.example",
  "maxAgents": 25
}

### List tenants
GET {{api}}/api/tenants?page=1&pageSize=25

### Enroll an agent
POST {{api}}/api/agents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantCode": "contoso",
  "machineName": "CONTOSO-PC01",
  "operatingSystem": "Windows 11 Pro",
  "processorCores": 8,
  "totalMemoryMb": 16384
}

### List online agents
GET {{api}}/api/agents?status=Online
